        "row": {
          "name": "Overconfidence (Martial)",
          "points": -5,
          "description": "Echani can sometimes be overly confident in their martial prowess, believing their disciplined training and ability to read opponents makes them superior. This can lead them to underestimate foes, dismiss non-combat solutions, or take unnecessary risks in combat against unconventional threats.",
